H("600.d.2.H",3,"A cook has stocks to simmer, vegetables to cut, and a special to plan before lunch. The best way to prioritize is to start with the tasks that:","take longest or are due first",["are easiest","are most fun","can be skipped"],"Long or urgent tasks must start first to finish on time.")
